WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.200
Meet Stepture. The fastest way to turn any workflow into a step-by-step guide.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.600
Open the extension, and hit Start Capture.

3
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:15.800
Then just work as usual. Every click is saved with a screenshot, and Stepture marks exactly where you clicked.

4
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.900
When you're done, hit Stop. Your guide is ready in seconds.

5
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.600
Every step is written for you.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:27.200
Need more context? Add tips, headers, or alerts anywhere.

7
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:31.000
Blur private details with a quick drag,

8
00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:33.000
and pick your annotation color.

9
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:40.000
Then let AI polish every step, turning quick click notes into clear, friendly instructions.

10
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:47.400
Finally, share your guide with a public link, or export it to PDF or Markdown in one click.

11
00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:53.000
Stepture. Stop writing docs. Start capturing.

